flowchart TD
  %% =========================================
  %% Phase 1 — Weekly Planner V2
  %% Parent Ingestion (Shows + Releases)
  %% Canonical diagram (Mermaid-only enforcement)
  %% =========================================

  A[Initialize Planner Settings Map]

  A --> R{Router — Sources Fan-out}

  %% -----------------
  %% Shows branch
  %% -----------------
  R --> S1[Read Shows Source]
  S1 -->|status = active| S2[Iterate Active Shows]
  S2 --> S3[Set Current Show Context]
  S3 --> S4[Set Current Show ID]
  S4 --> S5[Set Current Show Date]
  S5 --> S6[Compute Week Key — Shows]
  S6 --> S7[Search Existing Parent Row — Shows]
  S7 -->|0 rows| S8[Create Parent Row — Shows]

  %% -----------------
  %% Releases branch
  %% -----------------
  R --> R1[Read Releases Source]
  R1 -->|status = active| R2[Iterate Active Releases]
  R2 --> R3[Set Current Release Context]
  R3 --> R4[Set Current Release ID]
  R4 --> R5[Set Current Release Date]
  R5 --> R6[Compute Week Key — Releases]
  R6 --> R7[Search Existing Parent Row — Releases]
  R7 -->|0 rows| R8[Create Parent Row — Releases]
